    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' an kudá' naa amór Daudi tlaye', baraá Siklagi qoomár Daudi iwa Saulo wa nahhmiiti, garmoó Kishi. Inooínaká' an miguuseedá' Daudi gwaa ale/is baraá slaqwaraaro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' awa tlahhoó Benyamini tlahhayduú Saulo. Inooín maheeri tlaqutuuwo ngi ló'wa baaliyá' nee tlaa/e tlaqutuuwo ar dákw doó /iyáy nee oo doó basayhe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmooín oo úr a Ahieseri, nee aluuwo tay Yoashi, inooínaká' tsaraawo a daaqoó Shema'a kuduú gixsár Gibea, nee Yesieli nee Peleti daaqoó Asmaweti, nee Beraka nee Yehu kudaá Anatoti, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Ishmaya kuduú Gibeoni, inós a migusmoó wák sleeme baraá kudaá mibeeraá tame, nee an geeraharusmooín dinkwa nee Yeremia, nee Yahasieli, nee Yohanani nee Yosabadi kuduú Gedera, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Elusai, nee Yerimoti, nee Bealia, nee Shemaria, nee Shefatia kuduú guruú doó Harufi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Elkana, nee Ishia, nee Asareli, nee Yoeseri nee Yashobeamu kudaá guruú doó Kora, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee Yoela, nee Sebadia, daaqoó Yerohamu kuduú gixsár Gedori.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askaárír tlahhoó Gadi ar miguuse ar slaqwara gaa intsahh, kudá' naa tlaye' amór Daudi baraá koo/idá' gawit baraá darma, inooín ki ilakaaharen lawlu duqumisuuwo nee baqamór gaambuwo, gitsee/er'ín i dae tláq adór direeri, hi'iinór gawaá tlom'iiwo ki inslahh adór saaraga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Geeraharusmooín oo úr an Eseri, nee oo tsár a Obadia, nee oo tám an Eliabu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee oo tsiyáhh a Mishmana, nee oo kooán a Yeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee oo lahhoó' a Atai, nee oo faanqw a Elieli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee oo dakaát a Yohanani, nee oo gwaleél a Elisabadi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nee oo mibaangw a Yeremia, nee oo mibaá nee wak a Makbanai.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukuú Gadi a geeraharuusér slaqwara, oo niiná daqtá slaqwaruusér tsiiru gan geerahaar, nee oo úr daqtá slaqwaruusér kumuú wák gan geerahaar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuká' yaaér Yordani ngina waarahhiyé' qoomár slahhángw geera, qoomaadae yaaér Yordani ina háts ay gawaá gangeefaay. Inooín mukdá' baraá xatsaá hoót kuri diyaá/ bihhaá da/aáw nee awa /uwawo awa yaaér Yordani.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Benyamini bahh'ale nee oo Yudawo tana amór Daudi káy baraá koo/idá' gawit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daudi ngiwa ár gina al'áy, giri báy, «Kuungá' bar nina hardaté' as tawa mulqer'eé' nee iwa alee/isa', do' ló'wa awaare'. Ala kuungá' barnaxes aníng in geewaqatá' dír wakuuser'eene, tam aníng kuungá' na sadakuusiikahe, Munguú baabi'iirén i xumiis nee kuungá' nu iigahhaati.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naagáy Qeeruú Mungú Amasai gway hatsiís, kuduú geeraharusmoó úr oo kudaá mibeeraá tám, iri oó',",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aluuwo Daudi giri ilaaóh. Giri qaás geeraharuusér slaqwaruusér wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Askaárír hatlá' ar tlahhoó Manase tana haragwaá' amór Daudi qoomár Daudi nee múk Filisti tiwa alkona' as tawa slaqwi nee waawutmo Saulo. Ala Daudi múk Filisti gwaa alee/isiiká, asma geeraharuusér múk Filisti ta xurumiit, Daudi ngiwa geewaqaati dír Saulo, gawaá adoorihe Daudi kway alií ki/ís. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Daudi iwa Siklagírí kií/, múk tlahhoó Manase iri haragwaá' amór Daudi. Múk aa haragwaa' a kwí: Adna, nee Yosabadi, nee Yediaeli, nee Mikaeli, nee Yosabadi, nee Elihu, nee Siletai. Umuú heewo baraá kukae a geeraharusmoó slaqwaruusér múk kumuú wák baraá tlahhoó Manasewo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín Daudi nguna alee/iisiyé' as tawa slaqwi nee slaqwaruuse, asma inooín a múk miguuse nee geeraharuusér slaqwara. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Deeloodae umuúqo baalaaro múk /abén ina doogiigín baraá slaqwaruusér Daudiwo. Slaqwaruuse ina doogiín iri tláhh adór slaqwaruusér Mungú.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár Daudi iwa amór Hebroni i dirii'i, slaqwaruusér xooslaá koom nee ar slaqwarár xuu' ina hardáh dír Daudi ale, as nguwa alee/is as inós iwa waawuti'in kitángw Saulo wa ale, ar adoodá' AAKOÓ MUNGÚ ngira oó'. Faaror'ín a tí: ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk Yuda a kume lahhoó' nee tsiire dakaát oo lawlaá koóm nee gaambuwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1CH 12:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk tlahhoó Simeon a kume faanqw nee tsiiruú wák miguusér slaqwarár xuu'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1CH.12.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1CH.12.25"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
